## Solution design

The engine combines rule-based logic with TF-IDF text similarity. The rules handle fixed parameters such as SLA compliance; the similarity layer identifies the main customer issue and compares agent replies with a set of standard answers.

TODO(content): architecture diagram (IN-05).

## Build

The engine detects the first and final agent replies, classifies inquiry severity and calculates lead time. It handles real-world chat patterns: greetings, bot navigation, reopened tickets and customers who leave without replying. Results are delivered through a Streamlit app with Excel and PDF reports for the QA team.

